# SLSA Hall of Fame Nomination: Lifesaving CPR

> **Read this assessment first.** There is an eligibility problem with nominating "Lifesaving CPR" for the Hall of Fame as written, and a better vehicle may exist. My recommendation is below, followed by the strongest legitimate Hall of Fame draft so you are covered whichever way you decide.

